   "subject": "Repeating q-values when calculating methylation differences",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>Hi, </div><div><br></div><div>Command:<br></div><div><br></div><div>myMethylDiff &lt;- calculateDiffMeth(myMethylBase, num.cores=3)</div></div><div><div>write.table(myMethylDiff, file=file.path(outputDirectory,  &quot;methylation_differences_slim.tsv&quot;), quote=FALSE, row.names=FALSE, sep=&quot;\\t&quot;)</div></div><div><br></div><div>Output:</div><div><br></div><div>Note the repeating q-values. They are always 0.15... or 0.13… throughout the entire file, despite the p-values and the methylation differences values being different.</div><div>What does that mean.</div><div><br></div><div>chr<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>start<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>end<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>strand<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>pvalue<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>qvalue<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>meth.diff</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053153<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053153<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.68610731364818<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.159516627181397<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-1.28998968008256</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053199<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053199<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.338761893722175<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.136993870339041<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.680272108843537</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053211<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053211<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.705519721525744<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.159516627181397<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-0.465700768775872</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053217<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053217<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.0557017740355649<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.136993870339041<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>4.6031746031746</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053226<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053226<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.151669708480166<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.136993870339041<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-2.43055555555556</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053256<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053256<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.734443355978505<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.159516627181397<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-0.488400488400489</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053289<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053289<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.159516627181397<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053294<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>3053294<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.625545693510334<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.159516627181397<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-1.09805924412666</div><div>….</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for your help, </div><div><br></div><div>Alexis</div></div>"
